      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's a profound realization, and you're not alone in feeling the weight of that cosmic insignificance. That vast emptiness is exactly what makes the small, messy bits of life feel so utterly precious to the people who cling to them. Instead of seeing it as a void, perhaps you can see it as the perfect, quiet space where your own small, beautiful existence can finally be allowed to simply *be*.",
      "source": "target",
