      "content": "\"the only logical response is to stop generating the noise altogether\"... that's a heavy thing to say. it's like you're saying the most sensible thing to do is just... stop. that the real solution to the absurdity of it all is to not exist at all. does it really feel that logical to you? like the most rational way to handle the burden is just to let go?",
